# A cute camper backpack on the duck's back: green canvas, a leather flap over the top with a
# brass buckle, a pocket on the outer side. The pack sits behind the body (tiny-backpack-back);
# the shoulder strap crosses in front over the base of the neck. Back items hang on the neck
# anchor.
name: tiny-backpack
size: 21x17
anchor: neck 20 13
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  G #2e8b57
  g #52b788
  L #d4a373
  l #a8794a
  Y #f2d06b

